        meaning02: '<p>See <a href="/u">s</a> and <abbr title="Hyper">HTML</abbr>.</p> for an `a.crv` of `%% #region k`, `See [s][] and HTML.`, `%% #endregion k`, a blank line, `[s]: /u` and `*[HTML]: Hyper`. C2-N-020, C2-N-054: a line or region selection sees every definition of its file, as a section does (C2-N-031); 0.1 resolved only against the selected lines and wrote <p>See [s][] and HTML.</p>.',
