        meaning02: '<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td class="c" style="text-align: right;">a</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table> C2-B-182: a part may follow the alignment marks with no space, so `{>.c}` is right with the class `c`, and `{>^.c}` and `{>vx}` read the vertical mark too; 0.1 read a brace block with a part glued to the marks as cell text.',
