        meaning02: "<dl>\n  <dt>t</dt>\n  <dd>[^f]: note\ncont\ntail</dd>\n</dl> A footnote-shaped definition in a description and its following unprefixed line stay in the description under C2-B-081 and C2-B-083. Report the source range from the nested definition opener through the following unprefixed line.",
