        meaning02: '<ul>\n  <li>\n    <div class="inner">\n      <p>text</p>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ul> A line after a comment stays inside a closed nested div and item under C2-B-025 and C2-B-059. Report the source range from the comment line through the next retained line.',
        toolEntry: "U-382",
