        to: "",
        meaning02: "<ul>\n  <li>p\n{% a</li>\n</ul>\n<p>plain</p> A comment-fence-shaped line inside a braced comment changes which lines the list retains under C2-B-108 and C2-I-025. Report the source range from the braced comment opener through its closing mark.",
