        meaning02: "<p>a $`</p> C2-I-017 reads a backtick run with no closer of its length as text, and 0.1 wrote an empty math span. An adjacent closer joins the opener into a wider run, and a separator changes the empty value, so no spelling keeps the empty span. Report the parsed math range, `$` or `$$` with its backticks, at the end of inline content; do not rewrite.",
