        from: ':::: tabs\n::: tab "A"\na\n:::\n\n{selected}\n::: tab "B"\nb\n:::\n::::\n',
        to: ':::: tabs\n::: tab "A"\na\n:::\n\n{selected}\n::: tab "B"\nb\n:::\n::::\n',
        meaning02: '<div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="Tabs"><input type="radio" name="tabs-1" id="tabs-1-0"><label for="tabs-1-0">A</label><input type="radio" name="tabs-1" id="tabs-1-1" checked><label for="tabs-1-1">B</label>\u2026 C2-X-056 keeps `selected`: the first marked tab is the initially selected tab and with no mark the first tab is, as in 0.1. No source edit is needed; the renderer markup around it is a host matter (U-416, U-419).',
        toolEntry: "U-418",
