        to: "",
        meaning02: '<p><a href="/u">%% hidden</a></p> C2-I-023 keeps `%%` directly after the opener of a bracket, an inline note or extension content as text; 0.1 read it as a line comment that ended at the closer and wrote an empty link. U-405 to U-407 rewrite only their own verified sources. Report the source range from the `%%` through the closer of its frame.',
